@startuml HRMS_Sequence_Leave
title HRMS - Leave Application Sequence

actor Employee
actor Manager
participant "React Web" as UI
participant "Node.js API" as API
participant "Workflow Engine" as WF
database PostgreSQL as DB
queue "SQS" as SQS
participant "Notification Worker" as Worker
participant SES

Employee -> UI: Apply for leave
UI -> API: POST /leave-applications
API -> DB: BEGIN + SET LOCAL app.tenant_id
API -> DB: Validate policy / balance
API -> DB: Create leave application
API -> WF: Create approval workflow
API -> DB: Insert outbox event
DB --> API: Commit
API --> UI: Application submitted

Worker -> SQS: Consume LeaveApplied
SQS --> Worker: Event
Worker -> DB: Establish tenant context
Worker -> SES: Notify manager

Manager -> UI: Review leave
UI -> API: Approve / Reject
API -> DB: BEGIN + SET LOCAL app.tenant_id
API -> WF: Complete approval task
API -> DB: Update leave application
API -> DB: If approved, create leave ledger entry
API -> DB: Insert LeaveApproved/Rejected event
DB --> API: Commit
API --> UI: Decision saved

Worker -> SQS: Consume decision event
Worker -> DB: Mark notification state
Worker -> SES: Notify employee

@enduml
